WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.571
"Let go of me!" yelled Roxy.

2
00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:09.048
Four Professor Dittos dragged her down a hallway.

3
00:00:09.049 --> 00:00:14.487
Roxy kicked and squirmed.

4
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.396
The professors pushed her into a dark room.

5
00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:22.791
Roxy heard a heavy door slam behind her.

6
00:00:22.792 --> 00:00:26.474
"Aargh!" Roxy stamped her foot.

7
00:00:26.475 --> 00:00:28.296
The walls shook.

8
00:00:28.297 --> 00:00:31.005
"Rocket Girl!" said a familiar voice.

9
00:00:31.006 --> 00:00:33.053
"What are you doing here?"

10
00:00:33.054 --> 00:00:35.445
Roxy peered into the darkness.

11
00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:39.526
"Mayor Bloom?" she said.

12
00:00:39.527 --> 00:00:41.828
"I came here to find you

13
00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:46.548
. Your assistant said you stole the playground money this

14
00:00:46.549 --> 00:00:48.495
morning." Mayor Bloom

15
00:00:48.496 --> 00:00:50.659
frowned. "I didn't steal any

16
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:53.907
money. I never even got to City Hall this

17
00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:56.891
morning. I was kidnapped and brought here."

18
00:00:56.892 --> 00:00:58.822
Roxy was confused.

19
00:00:58.823 --> 00:01:01.766
"But your assistant saw you . . ."

20
00:01:01.767 --> 00:01:04.449
The mayor sighed.

21
00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:07.988
"She saw something that looked like me," he said.

22
00:01:07.989 --> 00:01:11.313
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me.

23
00:01:11.314 --> 00:01:13.445
And now I know why.

24
00:01:13.446 --> 00:01:16.900
He wanted my clone to steal that money!"

25
00:01:16.901 --> 00:01:22.901
Roxy gulped. "I think we have a bigger problem than stolen money, Mayor."

26
00:01:22.902 --> 00:01:25.976
"What do you mean?" asked Mayor Bloom.

27
00:01:25.977 --> 00:01:30.717
"Professor Ditto made a robot clone of me! " said

28
00:01:30.718 --> 00:01:33.716
Roxy. "Who knows what it will

29
00:01:33.717 --> 00:01:36.404
do?" "Oh no!" said Mayor

30
00:01:36.405 --> 00:01:39.456
Bloom. "It will have all of your super

31
00:01:39.457 --> 00:01:41.741
powers! You have to stop

32
00:01:41.742 --> 00:01:45.567
it!" Roxy nodded. "Step back,

33
00:01:45.568 --> 00:01:50.958
Mayor. I'm going to blast us out of

34
00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:54.810
here." Detective Smith was speeding toward Metro City

35
00:01:54.811 --> 00:01:57.592
University. A call came in on his

36
00:01:57.593 --> 00:02:00.364
radio. "Detective," said the police

37
00:02:00.365 --> 00:02:04.772
dispatcher. "The Metro City Museum is being

38
00:02:04.773 --> 00:02:08.669
robbed!" "I'll be there as soon as I can," said Detective

39
00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.452
Smith. "First I have to catch up with Rocket

40
00:02:11.453 --> 00:02:15.436
Girl. She went to Metro City University to find Mayor

41
00:02:15.437 --> 00:02:18.187
Bloom." "No, she didn't," said the

42
00:02:18.188 --> 00:02:20.868
dispatcher. "Rocket Girl is at the

43
00:02:20.869 --> 00:02:23.736
museum." "She is?" asked Detective

44
00:02:23.737 --> 00:02:25.837
Smith. "What is she doing

45
00:02:25.838 --> 00:02:29.584
there?" "You're not going to believe this," said the dispatcher.

46
00:02:29.585 --> 00:02:34.415
"But Rocket Girl is the one robbing the museum!"

47
00:02:34.416 --> 00:02:37.119
Detective Smith scratched his head.

48
00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:41.760
"What is going on today?"

49
00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:46.326
A minute later Detective Smith arrived at the museum.

50
00:02:46.327 --> 00:02:50.601
The Rocket Girl robot clone was carrying a priceless vase.

51
00:02:50.602 --> 00:02:52.825
Detective Smith was stunned.

52
00:02:52.826 --> 00:02:55.249
"Rocket Girl!" he cried.

53
00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.672
"What are you doing?"

54
00:02:58.673 --> 00:03:03.033
Whiz-hoo! Lasers shot from the clone's eyes.

55
00:03:03.034 --> 00:03:04.811
Detective Smith ducked.

56
00:03:04.812 --> 00:03:09.326
Just then the real Roxy landed in front of the detective.

57
00:03:09.327 --> 00:03:12.802
The lasers bounced off her chest.

58
00:03:12.803 --> 00:03:15.114
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

59
00:03:15.115 --> 00:03:17.846
He looked at the Rocket Girl robot clone.

60
00:03:17.847 --> 00:03:20.502
Detective Smith rubbed his eyes.

61
00:03:20.503 --> 00:03:26.921
"Two Rocket Girls?"

